n underground world never meant for them. Scavenge what little wealth the dark still offers, or miss a single jump and meet a stalagmite head-on. Mistakes are permanent, though death isn\u2019t always the worst outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.poster.avif?t=1771118729\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.webm?t=1771118729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.mp4?t=1771118729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF REAL PEOPLE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone faces the end of the world differently. Some cling to family, others to power, and a few simply to bloodlust. It\u2019s up to you to decide who to trust, who to betray, and whether your characters will sneak past their enemies, befriend them, or beat them to a pulp.</p>","developers":["Toasty"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/f988f75ca1a878288b1ea58f6e3c6faa9b1f6d3b/header.jpg?t=1771118729","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.6.8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel (runs well on Apple Silicon via Rosetta)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 capable graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_a